          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A link or QR code – no app, no account. Guests ask for what you put on the menu for guests, can find things in the places you share and add to the shopping list if you allow it. They never see quantities or purchases.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A link or QR code – no app, no account. Guests ask for what you put on the menu for guests, can find things in the places you share and add to the shopping list if you allow it. They never see quantities or purchases."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Link oder QR-Code – ohne App, ohne Konto. Gäste wünschen sich, was ihr für Gäste auf die Karte stellt, finden Sachen an den Orten, die ihr teilt, und schreiben auf die Einkaufsliste, wenn ihr das erlaubt. Mengen und Einkäufe sehen sie nie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A link without expiry keeps working until you revoke it – also if it is forwarded. Create it anyway?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
