    "Households only you belong to are deleted with all their data. From shared households you just leave – the others keep everything. Confirm with your Apple ID. An active App Store subscription must be cancelled in your Apple Account settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Households only you belong to are deleted with all their data. From shared households you just leave – the others keep everything. Confirm with your Apple ID. An active App Store subscription must be cancelled in your Apple Account settings."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Haushalte, zu denen nur du gehörst, werden mit allen Daten gelöscht. Aus geteilten Haushalten trittst du nur aus – die anderen behalten alles. Bestätige mit deiner Apple-ID. Ein laufendes App-Store-Abo kündigst du in den Einstellungen deines Apple-Accounts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Households only you belong to are deleted with all their data. From shared households you just leave – the others keep everything. Confirm with your password. An active App Store subscription must be cancelled in your Apple Account settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Households only you belong to are deleted with all their data. From shared households you just leave – the others keep everything. Confirm with your password. An active App Store subscription must be cancelled in your Apple Account settings."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Haushalte, zu denen nur du gehörst, werden mit allen Daten gelöscht. Aus gemeinsamen Haushalten trittst du nur aus – die anderen behalten alles. Bestätige mit deinem Passwort. Ein laufendes App-Store-Abo kündigst du in den Einstellungen deines Apple Accounts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Households only you belong to are deleted with all their data. From shared households you just leave – the others keep everything. We send you a code by e-mail to confirm. An active App Store subscription must be cancelled in your Apple Account settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Households only you belong to are deleted with all their data. From shared households you just leave – the others keep everything. We send you a code by e-mail to confirm. An active App Store subscription must be cancelled in your Apple Account settings."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Haushalte, zu denen nur du gehörst, werden mit allen Daten gelöscht. Aus geteilten Haushalten trittst du nur aus – die anderen behalten alles. Zur Bestätigung schicken wir dir einen Code per E-Mail. Ein laufendes App-Store-Abo kündigst du in den Einstellungen deines Apple-Accounts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
