    "Subscriptions renew automatically at the end of each period unless you cancel at least 24 hours before. The amount is charged to your Apple Account. You can manage and cancel your subscription any time in your Apple Account settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subscriptions renew automatically at the end of each period unless you cancel at least 24 hours before. The amount is charged to your Apple Account. You can manage and cancel your subscription any time in your Apple Account settings."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abos verlängern sich am Ende jedes Zeitraums automatisch, wenn du nicht mindestens 24 Stunden vorher kündigst. Der Betrag wird über deinen Apple Account abgerechnet. Verwalten und kündigen kannst du dein Abo jederzeit in den Einstellungen deines Apple Accounts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
